      en: ["The length of the Cauca River is approximately 1,350 kilometers.", "The river originates in the Páramo de Sotará in the Cauca department.", "Hidroituango on the Cauca is the largest hydroelectric project in Colombia.", "The river traverses a total of 9 different Colombian departments.", "It joins the Magdalena River in the Mompox Depression region.", "Illegal gold mining along its banks is a primary source of mercury contamination."],
