      en: ["The Guaviare River has a total length of approximately 1,497 kilometers.", "It serves as the boundary between the departments of Guaviare and Guainía.", "Its confluence with the Orinoco is located near San Fernando de Atabapo.", "San José del Guaviare is the most significant urban center along its course.", "The river is a vital habitat for the Amazon river dolphin (Inia geoffrensis).", "During the wet season, the river's water level can rise by several meters."],
